# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Governance, CI and licensing
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately owned by named individuals rather than @truera/trulens_maintainers.
# Ownership of these paths is not the same kind of privilege as ownership of a
# source directory:
#
#   - CODEOWNERS decides who owns everything else, so whoever can approve a change
#     to it can grant themselves ownership of any other path.
#   - A workflow or script can be edited to read secrets, or to approve pull
#     requests.
#   - area-reviewers.yml and MAINTAINERS.md decide who holds a role.
#   - CLA.md is a legal document.
#   - The pull request template carries the certification a contributor ticks.
#
# So these stay with a small set of Snowflake employees, and do not widen as the
# contributor ladder adds Area Reviewers. Two people rather than one, so that a
# holiday does not block a security fix to a workflow.
